    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I would recommend asking around among Japanese. 寒いでした is not used by native speakers - even young ones, though しないです is.",
      "html": "I would recommend asking around among Japanese. 寒いでした is not used by native speakers - even young ones, though しないです is.",
